# Work section cards

The `#work` fan has **five** cards (`.c1` through `.c5`). There is no `.c6`.

## Stacked (fan) offsets

Cards are centered and even:

- `.c1` `--tx:-280px` `--ty:14px` `--tr:-14deg`
- `.c2` `--tx:-140px` `--ty:-4px` `--tr:-7deg`
- `.c3` `--tx:0px` `--ty:-16px` `--tr:0deg`
- `.c4` `--tx:140px` `--ty:-4px` `--tr:7deg`
- `.c5` `--tx:280px` `--ty:14px` `--tr:14deg`

## Aligned (hover) spread

288px pitch. Outermost offset is 576px. JS `ALIGNED_ROW_HALF` must stay `576`.

- `.c1` `-576px`
- `.c2` `-288px`
- `.c3` `0`
- `.c4` `288px`
- `.c5` `576px`

Keep card size 280x590. Mobile (`max-width:760px`) stays a scroll-snap row.
